        "TileImage": "$($repository 8fd3d13a-6e7a-4f13-a096-1349d7a5892b).Image",
        "Description": "Thomas Cross has hired master thief Toby Hicks to steal the Highmoore tape during Jordan&apos;s recording session, using Abel de Silva as his inside man. Cross wants him to destroy it, but Hicks has invited Russian kingpin Vlad Volodin to buy the tape and sell it to corrupt US attorney Keith McKenzie. Some of Vlad&apos;s dirty money will be laundered through the Himmapan Hotel itself. Hicks, de Silva, Volodin, McKenzie and Mookjai have been cleared for retirement.",
